cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mizan"
abstract: >-
  Calculation tool for Turkish employment receivables at the level of a court
  expert report. For each item it produces a dated PDF report showing the
  inputs, the formula, the statutory basis and the source of every official
  table row used. Covers severance and notice pay (with periodic ceilings),
  annual leave, overtime, weekly rest and public holiday pay, gross to net
  conversion and interest. Legal choices are explicit parameters. Command line
  tool and a serverless web interface sharing the same calculation core.
authors:
